&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Understanding the logic from controllers (Plug-in/Embedded) to integrated drive-control units (Nayun/GTSD) and software platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Principles&lt;/strong&gt;: gLink-II gigabit ring network (100ns precision); core algorithms like PSO (Position Synchronized Output for 2μm interval drilling) and 5-axis RTCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;2-toolchain-proficiency&#34;&gt;2. Toolchain Proficiency
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OtoStudio&lt;/strong&gt;: Developed low-level motion logic (e.g., homing sequences) using ST language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Janus&lt;/strong&gt;: Designed process flows (e.g., automatic drilling cycles) via graphical blocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DriverStudio&lt;/strong&gt;: Performed servo parameter auto-tuning (vibration suppression, gain adjustment).&lt;/li&gt;
